beam_nl.out
Notched 3-point bending beam (2D) - adaptive nonlinear analysis (nonlocal damage) with Gmsh remeshing
adaptnlinearstatic nsteps 25 controlmode 1 rtolv 1.e-3 maxiter 300 stiffmode 1 renumber 1 equilmc 1 eetype 0 vartype 1 minlim 0.05 maxlim 0.9 mindens 12.0 maxdens 5.0 defdens 25.0 meshpackage 4 gmshgeo "beam.geo" gmshctrl "beam_nl.ctrl" profileopt 1 nmodules 1
vtkxml tstep_all domain_all primvars 1 1 cellvars 2 1 52
domain 2dPlaneStress
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_all element_all
ncrosssect 2 nmat 2 nbc 3 nic 0 nltf 2 nset 5
SimpleCS 1 thick 1.0 material 1 set 1
SimpleCS 2 thick 1.0 material 2 set 2
IsoLE 1 E 20.e3 n 0.2 d 0.0 talpha 0.0
idmnl1 2 E 20.e3 n 0.2 e0 1.25e-4 ef 1.e-3 damlaw 0 equivstraintype 4 r 40.0 wft 1 regionmap 2 1 0 d 0.0 talpha 0.0
BoundaryCondition 1 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 2 1 2 values 2 0.0 0.0 set 3
BoundaryCondition 2 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 2 values 1 0.0 set 4
BoundaryCondition 3 loadTimeFunction 2 dofs 1 2 values 1 -0.025 set 5
ConstantFunction 1 f(t) 1.0
PiecewiseLinFunction 2 nPoints 2 t 2 0.0 200.0 f(t) 2 0.0 200.0
Set 1 elements
Set 2 elements
Set 3 nodes
Set 4 nodes
Set 5 nodes

# Gmsh physical groups -> oofem properties
# (gmsh UNV element type 91: linear triangle)
group Elastic
elemprop set 1
etype[91] TrPlaneStress2D

group Concrete
elemprop set 2
etype[91] TrPlaneStress2D

group SupportL
nodeprop set 3

group SupportR
nodeprop set 4

group Load
nodeprop set 5

